Package: polyviz
Title: Polyglot Data Analysis and 'D3'-Powered Visualisation
Version: 0.9.0
Authors@R:
    person("Jake", "Stephan", email = "jake@stephan-j.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An exploratory data analysis toolkit with a pure R interface
    and a polyglot backend. Data ingestion is unified across CSV, 'SQLite'
    databases (via 'DBI'/'RSQLite'), and SAS datasets ('sas7bdat'/'xpt' via
    'haven'). Numeric profiling can be delegated to a bundled Python module
    (via 'reticulate') with a transparent pure-R fallback. Visualisations
    are rendered by a bundled copy of 'D3.js' v7 through 'htmlwidgets',
    giving interactive, animated 'D3' graphics - bar, line, scatter,
    force-directed networks, chord diagrams, and zoomable sunbursts -
    without writing any JavaScript.
